<paragraph style="-uslm-lc:I12" class="indent1" id="id4981d92d-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s8732/c/14"><num value="14">(14)</num><content> In the case of small chickpeas, $7.43 per hundredweight.</content>
</paragraph>
<paragraph style="-uslm-lc:I12" class="indent1" id="id4981d92e-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s8732/c/15"><num value="15">(15)</num><content> In the case of large chickpeas, $11.28 per hundredweight.</content>
</paragraph>
<paragraph style="-uslm-lc:I12" class="indent1" id="id4981d92f-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s8732/c/16"><num value="16">(16)</num><content> In the case of graded wool, $1.15 per pound.</content>
</paragraph>
<paragraph style="-uslm-lc:I12" class="indent1" id="id4981d930-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s8732/c/17"><num value="17">(17)</num><content> In the case of nongraded wool, $0.40 per pound.</content>
</paragraph>
<paragraph style="-uslm-lc:I12" class="indent1" id="id4981d931-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s8732/c/18"><num value="18">(18)</num><content> In the case of mohair, $4.20 per pound.</content>
</paragraph>
<paragraph style="-uslm-lc:I12" class="indent1" id="id4981d932-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s8732/c/19"><num value="19">(19)</num><content> In the case of honey, $0.69 per pound.</content>
</paragraph>
</subsection>
<subsection style="-uslm-lc:I19" class="indent2 firstIndent-2" id="id4981d933-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s8732/d"><num value="d" class="bold">(d)</num><heading class="bold"> Single county loan rate for other oilseeds</heading><content><p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">The Secretary shall establish a single loan rate in each county for each kind of other oilseeds described in subsections (a)(11), (b)(11), and (c)(11).</p>
</content>
</subsection>
<sourceCredit id="id4981d934-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb">(<ref href="/us/pl/110/234/tI/s1202">Pub. L. 110–234, title I, § 1202</ref>, <date date="2008-05-22">May 22, 2008</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/122/954">122 Stat. 954</ref>; <ref href="/us/pl/110/246/s4/a">Pub. L. 110–246, § 4(a)</ref>, title I, § 1202, <date date="2008-06-18">June 18, 2008</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/122/1664">122 Stat. 1664</ref>, 1682.)</sourceCredit>
